# Build context for sandbox/image/Dockerfile is the repository root (sandbox/image/build.sh).
# Only sandbox/supervisor/ and sandbox/image/dist/ are needed; everything else is noise.
.git
.gitignore
.env*
**/.env*
.github
.zs-logs
.vercel
apps
docs
infra
zed
*.md
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/target
sandbox/image/test
# Fixtures written by sandbox/image/test/run-local.sh; the image only needs dist/zed-remote-server.
sandbox/image/dist/test
sandbox/image/dist/image.json
